# Device files must round-trip byte-for-byte. mkshrc is sourced by mksh on an
# Android device: CRLF would break it, and Git's autocrlf would introduce it on
# checkout under Windows. -text disables all end-of-line conversion.
system/** -text
fdl/** -text
firmware/** -text
*.img -text
*.bin -text

# Key layouts are pushed verbatim to /system on the device. CRLF would break
# the layout parser, so keep them LF whatever Git's autocrlf is set to.
apps/*/keylayout/** -text
